## Decided Requirements

1. **True zero-knowledge encryption** - Accept that forgotten password = lost data
2. **Mandatory for all users** - Not opt-in, all data encrypted by default
3. **Hybrid approach for identity** - Keep email unencrypted for password reset and admin metrics

### What Gets Encrypted
| Encrypt | Don't Encrypt |
|---------|---------------|
| Task titles | User email |
| Project names | Numeric durations |
| Tags | Timestamps |
| User display name | Status flags |
| Actionbar preferences | IDs and relationships |

