## UX Considerations

### Warning on Settings Page
Add a prominent notice:
> "Your task data is encrypted with your password. If you forget your password, your task data cannot be recovered."

### Login Failure
When login fails, show clear message:
> "If you forgot your password, you can reset it, but your encrypted task data will be lost."

### Password Reset Flow
When resetting password:
> "Warning: Resetting your password will delete all your encrypted task data. This cannot be undone."

After reset, user starts fresh with empty task list.
